---
id: repo.analyze-codebase
title: Analyze Codebase
category: analysis
stage: [analyze, inspect, report]
purpose: Explain a bounded implementation, behavior, or data flow from repository evidence.
inputs: [analysis_question, repository_scope]
outputs: [evidence_map, analysis_report]
mutates_repository: false
